# "{2}{R}, Discard this card: It deals 2 damage to each creature." works from a hand only (CR 113.6b): with one Mjölnir on the
# battlefield and a second in hand, the battlefield one has no such ability to activate (refused) while the one in hand does.
# The discarded card deals 2 damage to every creature, both players' (CR 120.3): Bot1's Magda, Brazen Outlaw (toughness 1) and
# Bot2's Belladonna Took (toughness 2, exactly lethal) die, Bot2's Adeline, Resplendent Cathar (toughness 4) lives with 2 damage;
# neither player loses life. The damage is the discarded card's (the Mjölnir on the battlefield is attached to nothing), so
# Adeline has 2 damage marked and survives.

